                                        "sense_id": "bd96754d-2f38-3a4e-8aea-2246b8984789",
                                        "entry_id": "85d1c9cd-601c-364c-a9f6-bc6fbe119953",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The characteristic or state of being slutty."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf416d43-7a16-457b-90dd-ad9655a40e93",
                                                "sense_id": "bd96754d-2f38-3a4e-8aea-2246b8984789",
                                                "text": "As a teenager, she dresses like a punk rocker in outfits \"ingeniously designed to disguise sluttiness as irony\" yet still finds she cannot bring herself to spit her gum on the sidewalk, her rebellion stifled by the fact that she \"cared too much about making other people cross with her.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e8f3e6ca-1422-4dce-a526-45dea85a302f",
                        "source_entry_id": "b36a389c-e5d9-3d62-9f7f-9dbda31c2226",
                        "source_sense_id": "b1cbc154-907c-3974-868d-c40607b55039",
                        "target_lang_word": "sluttishness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sluttishness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a7f06ac-1c7d-3fad-927b-daf7c227b657",
                                        "entry_id": "7587612a-e7f5-3ac9-9b97-a2c854825d52",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state or quality of being sluttish (dirty or untidy; disorderly)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfe9d9fb-513b-4e59-86ea-1b85e89e9011",
                                                "sense_id": "5a7f06ac-1c7d-3fad-927b-daf7c227b657",
                                                "text": "For my part I would rather counſell you to deſtroy your Rattes and Miſe with Traps, Banes, or Weeſels: for beſides the ſluttiſhneſſe ⁊ lothſomeneſſe of the Catte (you know what ſhe layes in the Malt heape) ſhe is moſt daungerous and pernicious among children, as I mee ſelf haue had good experience."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b414d92-cafd-47d8-83d2-e615c3f118de",
                                                "sense_id": "5a7f06ac-1c7d-3fad-927b-daf7c227b657",
                                                "text": "Well, praiſed be the Gods, for thy foulneſſe; ſluttiſhneſſe may come heereafter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a20354d-c92c-48ab-8554-73b1c46ebd43",
                                                "sense_id": "5a7f06ac-1c7d-3fad-927b-daf7c227b657",
                                                "text": "I looked at the window, but it was all in vain ... I was not a bit the better for it! I even bethought me to send for Matrona, and was giving her some fatherly admonitions in regard to the spider’s web and sluttishness in general; but she simply stared at me in amazement and went away without saying a word, so that the spider's web is comfortably hanging in its place to this day."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a8ddca51-3efa-3dd3-b848-17fd543661d5",
                                        "entry_id": "7587612a-e7f5-3ac9-9b97-a2c854825d52",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state or quality of being sluttish (like a slut; sexually promiscuous)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually",
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f940e0e-1e8c-4039-81f9-7fb5c656d1c9",
                                                "sense_id": "a8ddca51-3efa-3dd3-b848-17fd543661d5",
                                                "text": "Before long, the wife begins to reveal her sluttishness and, by the time the play is over, she has arranged a satisfactory financial and sexual deal with her in-laws."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03f3ac53-0ab7-445c-ab0b-1d54b7c9d90a",
                                                "sense_id": "a8ddca51-3efa-3dd3-b848-17fd543661d5",
                                                "text": "Far more in demand among the Toughs than I, Rammelkamp was an object of gossip and curiosity among the other boys, who occasionally made fun of his name but not his sluttishness. We once compared notes on our sexual initiations, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4adebd4-f297-4c22-b668-00aeb71d5968",
                                                "sense_id": "a8ddca51-3efa-3dd3-b848-17fd543661d5",
                                                "text": "She still felt attracted to him, but her desire for him had been outweighed by pangs of guilt about her uncharacteristic sluttishness. Yes, he was gorgeous, sexy, funny and interesting, but he was also a complete stranger and she just didn’t do that sort of thing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
